<Layout
	title="Specialty Coffee, Indian Style | Sula Chai Café Vancouver"
	description="The story of Indian coffee in Vancouver. From Chikmagalur to East Van. Why specialty coffee lovers are discovering Alai Coffee at Sula Chai Café."
